---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "THC:CBD Ratio"
letter: "T"
anchor: "thc-cbd-ratio"
category: "cannabinoids"
---

The proportion of THC to CBD in a cannabis product. Ratio meaningfully shapes the experience: high-THC, low-CBD products produce full intoxication with higher anxiety risk; balanced ratios (1:1 or 2:1) produce moderate intoxication with reduced anxiety; high-CBD, low-THC products produce minimal intoxication. Balanced ratios are generally recommended for beginners and anxiety-prone users.

→ [What Is THC?](/cannabis-101/what-is-thc/)
